            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Both lab-test finished products and certify them as low FODMAP at a stated serving. Monash University developed the diet and runs its program through the Monash FODMAP app; FODMAP Friendly is an Australian program with its own logo and app. Either logo means the product was tested, unlike an unverified low FODMAP claim."
